scheduled.\n\nThanks,\nThomas Lee\n\n\n--- Match 6 (Relevance: 0.2769359730990586) ---\nFrom: hr@enron.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Your Benefits Enrollment Deadline\nDate: 2025-10-06T14:45:00Z\nStatus: Read\nBody:\nThis is a reminder to complete your benefits enrollment by October 20. Please log in to the HR portal to review and confirm your coverage options for the upcoming plan year.\nIf you do not make your selections by the deadline, your current benefits may automatically renew or default coverage may apply.\n\nFor any questions or assistance, please contact the HR Benefits Team at help@enron.com.\n\n\n--- Match 7 (Relevance: 0.24676417879388465) ---\nFrom: tim@ti.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Interest in Research Collaboration\nDate: 2025-10-15T15:28:00Z\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nDear Vince,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Tim, and I'm part of the Advanced Research team at Texas Instruments. We've been following your recent work and are very interested in exploring potential collaboration opportunities on an upcoming research project.\n\nIf you're open to it, I'd appreciate the chance to schedule a call next week to discuss how our teams might work together.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nTim\nTexas Instruments\n\n\n--- Match 8 (Relevance: 0.2345831094637634) ---\nFrom: no-reply@swissair.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Your Flight Booking Confirmation\nDate: 2025-10-01T08:45:00Z\nStatus: Read\nBody:\nThank you for booking your flight from Zurich to Barcelona. Your itinerary is attached.\n\n\n--- Match 9 (Relevance: 0.23177069886688567) ---\nFrom: hr@enron.com\nTo: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nSubject: Welcome to Enron - Your Employee Information\nDate: 2024-01-10T09:00:00Z\nStatus: Unread\nBody:\nDear Vince J. Kaminski,\n\nWelcome to Enron! We are excited to have you join our team.\n\nYour designation will be Managing Director of Enron Research Corp. and your Employee ID 